-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",34,{
[1057]="70067545\n1\tYou should complete quests in Jeb Khâtel to win the Orcs' trust.\t\n2\tTalk to Zagdúr in Kafagur\tYou have helped the inhabitants of Kafagur. You should return to Zagdúr in Kafagur and talk to her.\n3\tTalk to Grúshul\tAccording to Zagdúr, a Man was sighted outside of Kafagur. You should talk to the guard Grúshul for more information.\n",
[1058]="70062611\n1\tComplete 'Dealing with Bloodhollow'\030Complete 'Introduction to Crafting'\030Complete 'Learning to Fish in Lhan Garan'\tTalfryn asked you to help a few key people in and around Lhan Garan. Help Eluna, Madog, and Undeg.\n",
[1059]="70045F25\n1\tComplete quests in aiding Minas Tirith after the battle (total: 4)\tPeople who need aid after the battle may be found either in the First Circle of the city or in the Houses of Healing in the Sixth Circle. You have been asked to aid the people of Minas Tirith as they recover from the Battle of the Pelennor Fields. Completing this quest will fail any Aiding Minas Tirith quests not yet completed for the day.\n",
[1060]="70072B6F\n1\tSpeak with Sênjar in Sormedân\030Speak with Lurâkha in Sormedân\030Speak with Khaljûn in Sormedân\tElder Jurmêna has requested you speak with Sênjar, Khaljûn, and Lurâkha about their daily troubles and assist them where you are able.\n2\tReturn to Elder Jurmêna in Sormedân\tReturn to Elder Jurmêna in Sormedân and let her know you have spoken with each of the villagers.\n",
[1061]="70038643\n1\tBring fifty tokens to Meg Proudfoot in Michel Delving\030Collect Bounder's Token (total: 50)\tAid the Bounders with a donation! NOTE: This quest will consume fifty Bounder's Tokens.\n",
[1062]="7004DA4E\n1\tCollect berries (total: 5)\030Collect firewood (total: 8)\tThe camps of the Easterling refugees are east and across the river from Dale. You should help the refugees by gathering firewood and blue berries for them.\n2\tDeliver the firewood and berries to Enkárvo\tEnkárvo can be found in the Dorwinion camp, east and across the river from Dale. You should bring the berries and firewood you gathered back to Enkárvo.\n",
[1063]="7004DA4F\n1\tDefeat wolves (total: 12)\tYou should defeat wolves in the areas around the refugee encampments, east and across the river from Dale.\n2\tTalk to Komúsi\tYou should speak to Komúsi, who can be found in the Dorwinion camp, east and across the river from Dale.\n",
[1064]="7002EF82\n1\tComplete quests aiding the Eastemnet (total: 5)\tPeople who need aid can be found primarily in Harwick, Cliving, Eaworth, and Snowbourn. You have been asked to aid the people of the Eastemnet.\n",
[1065]="7000BFCB\n1\tDefeat Thrâng\tThrâng is within The Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu. Tortrygg has asked you to find and defeat Thrâng, leader of the Ghâshfra in the Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu.\n2\tTalk to Iorelen\tIorelen is at Iorelen's Camp above The Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu. You should bring your report of Thrâng's defeat to Iorelen and learn how you should proceed.\n",
[1066]="70018F7F\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Nanduhirion (total: 10)\030Set fire to Orc barricades (total: 5)\tOrcs can be found north-west of Talan Haldir, along the road that runs through Nanduhirion to Moria. They have erected barricades outside their camps along the road: Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh, and Athmadhul. Hadroneth has asked you to defeat Orcs in Nanduhirion and to set fire to the barricades they erect outside their camps along the road.\n2\tTalk to Hadroneth\tHadroneth is on Talan Haldir, located on the banks of Nimrodel, south-east of Nanduhirion. You have continued your efforts against the Orc invaders of Nanduhirion, slaying many of their number and setting fire to the barricades they have erected along the road.\n",
[1067]="70018F80\n1\tCollect Orc weapons (total: 5)\030Defeat Orc waylayers in Nanduhirion (total: 4)\tOrc camps can be found all along the road that runs through Nanduhirion, north-west of Talan Haldir. Orc waylayers prowl along the road as well, and can be found on the outskirts of the camps there. Maethoron has asked you to continue your efforts against the Orcs of Moria that have invaded Nanduhirion: defeating their waylayers along the road and stealing weapons from their camps.\n2\tBring Orc weapons to Maethoron\tMaethoron is on Talan Haldir, located near the banks of Nimrodel, south-east of Nanduhirion. You have stolen weapons from the Orc camps of Nanduhirion and defeated more Orc Waylayers along the road, and should return now to Maethoron with news of your success.\n",
[1068]="70018FBE\n1\tRecover arrows from Orc corpses near the border of Lórien (total: 5)\tThe corpses of Orcs slain by the hidden Galadhrim along the border of Lothlórien, east of Echad Andestel, can be the source of more arrows desired by Celegúien. She warned you against going too near the border, for the Galadhrim will shoot if they do not know you. Celegúien is waiting for you to recover arrows from the corpses of Orcs slain along the border of Lórien.\n2\tBring Elf-arrows to Celegúien\tCelegúien is in Echad Andestel, the camp along the banks of Nimrodel, west of the border of Lórien. You have recovered arrows from the corpses of Orcs along the border of the Golden Wood, and should return now to Celegúien.\n3\tPick up a bundle of arrows next to Celegúien\tMeredhrandir is at Mekhem-bizru, the camp just outside the eastern entrance to Moria, far to the north-west of Echad Andestel. Celegúien told you to follow the road west and north until you reach Mekhem-bizru, and to avoid the Orcs that prowl within Nanduhirion as you carry the arrows to Meredhrandir. You have been told to bring a bundle of arrows to Meredhrandir at Mekhem-bizru.\n4\tTalk to Meredhrandir\tMeredhrandir is at Mekhem-bizru, the camp just outside the eastern gate of Moria. You have brought the arrows to Meredhrandir and should now speak with him about the journey.\n",
[1069]="70018FBF\n1\tCollect Orc filth from the banks of the Nimrodel (total: 5)\tOrc filth can be found north and south along the banks of the river Nimrodel, west of the border of Lórien. Dindirith has asked you to once again cleanse the banks of the Nimrodel of the Orc filth that sullies them.\n2\tBring Orc filth to Dindirith\tDindirith is at Echad Andestel, north of the road that runs to Lórien and west of the border. You have collected Orc filth from the banks of the Nimrodel and should bring it now to Dindirith.\n3\tBurn Orc filth in a fire within one of the Orc camps in Nanduhirion\tThere are Orc camps all along the road that runs through Nanduhirion, west and north of Echad Andestel. Dindirith has asked you to burn the Orc filth you collected in a fire located within one of the Orc camps along the road through Nanduhirion.\n4\tTalk to Dindirith\tDindirith is in Echad Andestel, outside the border of Lórien and east of Nanduhirion. You have once again disposed of the Orc filth and should report now to Dindirith.\n",
[1070]="700687B9\n1\tChakâr has asked you to deliver medical supplies to healers in and around Dâr Tabib. Dâr Tabib is located in the south-west area of the Tor-gardens.\t\n2\tCompleted\tYou have finished distributing medical supplies among the Dâr Tabib healers.\n",
[1071]="70057F97\n1\tFind a grooming brush from the equipment crate\030Collect apples from the apple crate\tGrooming brushes and apples are in crates at the back of the city stables. You will need both items in order to help Loborís with the horses.\n2\tGroom the horses (total: 3)\030Feed the horses (total: 3)\tThe horses that require attention can be found around the city stables. Loborís has asked you to groom or give treats to several of them.\n3\tReturn to Loborís\tLoborís is working near the front doors in the city stables. She will want to hear that you've taken care of the horses.\n",
[1072]="70071B49\n1\tTalk to Mísikir\tMêshaget needs to speak to the Lord of the city, Châmelek Gêta, and suggested you talk to Mísikir, the captain of the guard.\n2\tFind the guard watching over the road\tMísikir has given you a water-skin and asked you to find Cherêka, who watches over the road that all must take to approach the mountain-top. She should be somewhere nearby, looking down upon the road.\n3\tTalk to Cherêka and give her the water-skin\tYou have found Cherêka, keeping watch over the road that leads to Jiret-menêsh from the city above. You should talk to her and give her the water Mísikir asked you to deliver.\n4\tTalk to Mísikir\tYou have delivered the water to Cherêka, and had a nice chat. You should return to Mísikir, who was near Jiret-menêsh's stable-master.\n5\tTalk to Khagâmi\tMísikir tells you that a woman was recently looking for you, but does not know where she went. You should find Khagâmi in Jiret-menêsh.\n6\tTalk to Mêshaget\tKhagâmi thanked you for getting her safely to Jiret-menêsh. Mêshaget appears to have something to say. You should talk to Mêshaget.\n",
[1073]="7003511F\n1\tIntroduce yourself to Cyneberg, the Thane's daughter\tCyneberg can be found in Scylfig, unloading battle-supplies from storage. You should assist Cyneberg, the Thane's daughter.\n2\tPick up the wood slats\030Pick up the barrel of arrows\030Pick up the food rations\tArrows, wood slats, and food rations can be found at the cart near Cyneberg. You should deliver the battle preparations around town so that the people of Scylfig can brace for the looming Orc attack.\n3\tDeliver the wood slats to the waggon east of Cyneberg\030Deliver the food rations to the waggon north of Cyneberg\030Deliver the barrel of arrows to the waggon west of Cyneberg\tThe battle-readying items you gathered can be distributed around Scylfig. You should bring the preparatory items to various points throughout Scylfig.\n4\tSpeak with Cyneberg in the centre of Scylfig\tCyneberg is in Scylfig. You should speak with Cyneberg.\n",
[1074]="700493F1\n1\tConfront the wounded devoted\tThe wounded devoted can be found near Aiglos. You should confront the wounded devoted from the Order of the Eye.\n2\tFind and defeat Rabôkhor\030Collect a corrupted trinket\tRabôkhor, high priest of the Order of the Eye, can be found in Dor Amarth. You should find and defeat Rabôkhor.\n3\tBring the corrupted idol near Aiglos\tAiglos can be found in Dor Amarth. You should bring the corrupted idol you found to Aiglos.\n4\tConfront the wounded devoted\tThe wounded devoted can be found near Aiglos. You should confront the wounded devoted from the Order of the Eye.\n5\tTalk to Legolas\tLegolas can be found near Aiglos in Dor Amarth. You should speak with Legolas.\n6\tTalk to Hithgol\tHithgol can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth. You should talk to Hithgol.\n",
[1075]="70007818\n1\tTalk to Eldo Swatmidge\tEldo Swatmidge lives east of Staddle and north and east of Widow Froghorn's farm. Longo Daegmund has asked you to speak with Eldo Swatmidge about his dog's illness and learn if there is some remedy he knows that may cure him.\n2\tBring the fennel seeds to Eldo Swatmidge\030Collect fennel seeds (total: 3)\tNeekerbreekers can be found most commonly in the southern Midgewater Marshes. Eldo Swatmidge's farm is west of the Marshes and east of Staddle. Longo Daegmund sent you to speak with Eldo Swatmidge about a cure for Gar, his dog, but Eldo is missing the fennel seeds he needs to make the remedy. Eldo tells you that the Neekerbreekers have an affinity for fennel, and it may be possible to find some caught in their pincers.\n3\tBring Eldo's herbal remedy to Gar\tLongo Daegmund and his dog Gar are by Ferdibrand Took's waggon just west of the town square in Staddle. Eldo has prepared a herbal remedy to cure Longo's dog Gar of the illness troubling him and told you to have the dog drink it.\n4\tTalk to Longo Daegmund\tLongo Daegmund is next to his dog, Gar, by Ferdibrand Took's waggon west of the town square of Staddle. Longo is waiting expectantly to speak with you.\n",
[1076]="7000C38A\n1\tDefeat Aklash\tAklash is in the throne room of Goblin-town, to the north-east of Glóin's camp. Tralli Gemfinder has asked you to find and defeat the leader of the Great Goblin's soldiers within the throne room of Goblin-town.\n2\tSpeak with Tralli Gemfinder at Glóin's camp\tTralli Gemfinder is at Glóin's camp, just outside the entrance to Goblin-town. You entered the Great Goblin's throne room and found Aklash. After a harrowing battle, you defeated the goblin and should now return to Tralli Gemfinder.\n",
[1077]="7004D090\n1\tReturn to the Jangovar camp of Urûshoba\tYou should enter the Jangovar encampment of Urûshoba, south-east of Tay Yoldash in the Dale-lands.\n2\tDefeat enemies in Urûshoba (total: 12)\030Destroy weapons in Urûshoba (total: 10)\030Defeat Akshir\tYou should attack the Jangovar encampment of Urûshoba, which is located south-east of Tay Yoldash in the Dale-lands.\n3\tReturn to Erna\tErna can be found in the Great-keep in Dale. You should return to Queen Regent Erna with news of your fight with Akshir.\n",
[1078]="70037E75\n1\tThe Entwade-slaying can be found in south-eastern Kingstead along the road through the forests of the Eastfold. Agelman has asked that you help him bury the victims of the White Hand attack to provide them some measure of peace.\t\n2\tBury Léoflad\tLéoflad can be found amidst the wreckage along the road to the Eastfold in south-eastern Kingstead. You have aided Agelman in burying the people of Entwade, and have discovered Léoflad's body amidst the wreckage. You should bury her as well before speaking to Agelman.\n3\tTalk to Agelman\tAgelman is at your side or can be rallied to your side by sounding your horn. Agelman has interrupted you, calling you aside before you could finish burying Léoflad. You should speak to him and discover what he wants.\n",
[1079]="7003783B\n1\tTalk to Arcil\tThane Arcil is in the Mead Hall of Aldburg. Thane Arcil has invited you to join him for dinner. He and Éothain will attempt to resolve their differences and determine a course of action to deal with the Orcs. You should talk to Arcil when you are prepared to enter the Mead Hall of Aldburg for dinner.\n2\tTalk to Arcil\tBoth Arcil and Éothain stated their case about which Orc-tribe poses the greatest threat. You should speak with Arcil and let him know your thoughts.\n",
[1080]="70035599\n1\tTalk to Ránmald\tRánmald is in the refugees' cave north of Byre Tor. You should speak with Ránmald.\n2\tHear Aldstan's last wish\tAldstan is in the refugees' cave north of Byre Tor. You should speak with Aldstan.\n3\tHear Ránmald's words to Aldstan\tRánmald is in the refugees' cave north of Byre Tor. You should speak with Ránmald.\n4\tTry to rouse the Thane\tAldstan is in the refugees' cave north of Byre Tor. You should speak with Aldstan.\n",
[1081]="7004DA6D\n1\tUse Barrel-rack\tBarrel-racks can be found throughout the Hall Under the Mountain. Snállar has asked you to knock on various barrels of ale to try to expose the ale-thieves in Erebor.\n2\tTalk to Snállar\tSnállar can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have driven off several ale-soaked cave-claws in the Hall Under the Mountain and should now return to Snállar.\n",
[1082]="7006A77D\n1\tDeliver the broken metal clubs to a collection box\030Collect broken metal clubs ([see journal]/10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire broken metal clubs.\n",
[1083]="7006A780\n1\tDeliver the gorgeous ears to a collection box\030Collect gorgeous ears ([see journal]/10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire gorgeous ears.\n",
[1084]="7006A77C\n1\tDeliver the gorgeous furs to a collection box\030Collect gorgeous furs ([see journal]/10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire gorgeous furs.\n",
[1085]="7006A77E\n1\tDeliver the gorgeous sword sheaths to a collection box\030Collect gorgeous sword sheaths ([see journal]/10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire gorgeous sword sheaths.\n",
[1086]="7006A77F\n1\tDeliver the nasty skins to a collection box\030Collect nasty skin ([see journal]/10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire nasty skins.\n",
[1087]="7000E900\n1\tCollect Stars of Old Cider from the Prancing Pony\tThe Prancing Pony Inn is in Bree, east of the Shire. Stars of Old Cider should be bought from Butterbur at the Prancing Pony.\n2\tBring the Stars of Old Cider to Foxglove Grubb\tFoxglove Grubb is in Brockenborings in the Shire, west of Bree. Foxglove Grubb has asked you to collect a bit of \"Stars of Old\" cider for her from the Prancing Pony. Once you have the cider, you should bring it back to Foxglove.\n",
[1088]="700216EE\n1\tCollect fake Stars of Old Cider from The Forsaken Inn\tAnlaf the Forlorn is in The Forsaken Inn in the Lone-lands. You should collect fake Stars of Old Cider, actually Forsaken Cider, from Anlaf the Forlorn.\n2\tBring the fake Stars of Old Cider to Foxglove Grubb\tFoxglove Grubb is in Brockenborings in the Shire, waiting for you to deliver the Stars of Old Cider. You should bring the fake Stars of Old Cider, actually Forsaken Cider, to Foxglove Grubb before the time runs out.\n",
})
